<title>USA: First Financial files for $75 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>First Financial files for $75 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Financial Caribbean Corp filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on Monday for up to $75 million in senior notes due 2006.</p>
<p>The mortgage banking company said net proceeds will be used to repay certain existing indebtedness and for general corporate purposes, including possible acquisitions.</p>
</text>
